,"role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4aurjKq2sIGPHZSpjLDp6BIHV2.jpg"},{"id":1037368,"name":"Sophie Ellis-Bextor","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dvV48vgRxvtBDzA6dYLPuaCoULV.jpg"},{"id":15909,"name":"Sam Conway","role":"Self"},{"id":2325595,"name":"Rachael Blair","role":"Self"},{"id":2325597,"name":"Garth Hill","role":"Self"},{"id":2325598,"name":"Naomi Liston","role":"Self"},{"id":1615151,"name":"Pamela Smyth","role":"Self"},{"id":2325600,"name":"Patrick Strapazon","role":"Self"},{"id":3673435,"name":"Derek Carroll","role":"Self-General","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hUvsG9u6xOTUC9Br74dXFGKiBNA.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il Trono di Spade: The Last Watch","overview":"Il documentario conduce nel magico mondo della serie Il Trono di Spade indagando sulla produzione, sviscerando contenuti inediti e mostrando tutto ciò che ruota dietro all'ottava stagione della serie. L'attenzione si concentra dunque su tutto ciò che è avvenuto dietro la macchina da presa e sull'immenso lavoro fatto dalla troupe per la realizzazione di uno dei prodotti più innovativi degli anni Duemila."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"For a year, acclaimed British filmmaker Jeanie Finlay was embedded on the set of the hit HBO series “Game of Thrones,” chronicling the creation of the show’s most ambitious and complicated season.  Debuting one week after the series 8 finale, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH delves deep into the mud and blood to reveal the tears and triumphs involved in the challenge of bringing the fantasy world of Westeros to life in the very real studios, fields and car-parks of Northern Ireland.  Made with unprecedented access, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH is an up-close and personal portrait from the trenches of production, following the crew and the cast as they contend with extreme weather, punishing deadlines and an ever-excited fandom hungry for spoilers.  Much more than a “making of” documentary, this is a funny, heartbreaking story, told with wit and intimacy, about the bittersweet pleasures of what it means to create a world – and then have to say goodbye to it.","tagline":"A farewell to Westeros with the people who built the realm"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wN88K2YtDZEoRQngTDwBOjfJVlI.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wN88K2YtDZEoRQngTDwBOjfJVlI.png","language":"en","width":1862,"height":389}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tVyKpOYDtKzs4SOYCbZn4YNFWHI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tVyKpOYDtKzs4SOYCbZn4YNFWHI.jpg","language":"en","width":1412,"height":2118},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/326nGnxFNGN1zDXvKU9qjzLhcVH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/326nGnxFNGN1zDXvKU9qjzLhcVH.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9qpuNPi06IdqqZdRunRRSOl65RS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9qpuNPi06IdqqZdRunRRSOl65RS.jpg","language":"en","width":1412,"height":2118},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3CNe53TWtNnHuBqbJntP13ziFaD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3CNe53TWtNnHuBqbJntP13ziFaD.jpg","language":"en","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s4UrbUIzSiaq8lU37k8XzBiIJKW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s4UrbUIzSiaq8lU37k8XzBiIJKW.jpg","language":"en","width":607,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kI3Jnqkx8sJBjL70d6faMCmLz1z.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kI3Jnqkx8sJBjL70d6faMCmLz1z.jpg","language":"en","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vDdPew9aL7q8aL4lI3omXqY6MuB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vDdP